Description: Upstream Linux kernel bundle for Milk-V Duo 256M
 Builds an upstream Linux kernel package for the Milk-V Duo 256M from a
 recipe-only Debian packaging repository. Board-specific DTS support and
 the final kernel configuration are expected to be maintained in debian/.
